# Fuss {2}{R/W} (CR 107.4e, 122.1, 508.1): "Put a +1/+1 counter on each attacking creature you control." Ornithopter and Mox Ruby/Pearl/Jet are
# cast on turn 1; on turn 3 Bot1 attacks with two Ornithopters (two attackers) and keeps Memnite home. The hybrid symbol
# needs red or white: Mox Jet, Mox Sapphire and Mox Emerald (three mana, none of them red or white) cannot pay for it, so the cast is
# refused until Mox Ruby is cast; Fuss then puts a counter on both attackers only. Bot2's Memnite (blocking) and Bot1's Memnite
# (staying home) stay 1/1.

